>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SIMULADOR-JUROS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CAPITAL            PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-TAXA               PIC 9(2)V999 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-MESES              PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-MONTANTE           PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-JUROS              PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Capital inicial: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-CAPITAL
    DISPLAY "Taxa mensal (ex.: 1.500): " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-TAXA
    DISPLAY "Quantidade de meses: " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT WS-MESES

    CALL "CALCULAR-JUROS"
        USING WS-CAPITAL WS-TAXA WS-MESES WS-MONTANTE WS-JUROS
    END-CALL

    DISPLAY "Montante ao final: " WS-MONTANTE
    DISPLAY "Juros acumulados: " WS-JUROS
    GOBACK.
